#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10002
#: 47ab4e8c3ee34164a1c900638d395bba
msgid "HHT: Analysis"
msgstr "HHT: 解析"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10004
#: 6f2e7a6925e24f76a808e9c8297bd339
msgid ""
"This tutorial explains the procedure for **Hilbert-Huang Transform (HHT)** "
"analysis using **gwexpy**. HHT is well-suited for analyzing nonlinear and "
"non-stationary signals, and is a powerful method for extracting local "
"frequency variations (instantaneous frequency) that cannot be captured by "
"traditional Fourier or wavelet transforms. The sample code in this tutorial "
"uses `TimeSeries.hht()`."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、**gwexpy** を用いた **ヒルベルト・ファン変換 (HHT)** 解析の手順を解説します。HHT "
"は非線形・非定常な信号の解析に適しており、従来のフーリエ変換やウェーブレット変換では捉えられない局所的な周波数変動（瞬時周波数）を抽出する強力な手法です。このチュートリアルのサンプルコードは"
" `TimeSeries.hht()` を使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10008
#: d8fd70fd305746ab835099a36a40e6ef
msgid "HHT consists of two main steps:"
msgstr "HHT は主に 2 つのステップから構成されます："

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10009
#: 8af9f672b5124879ac2a27b17f71668f
msgid ""
"**Empirical Mode Decomposition (EMD)**: Decomposes the signal into Intrinsic"
" Mode Functions (IMFs)."
msgstr "**経験的モード分解 (EMD)**: 信号を固有モード関数 (IMF) に分解します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10010
#: a71c63ac68694f6e93786cfd9efffeaa
msgid ""
"**Hilbert Spectral Analysis**: Applies the Hilbert transform to each IMF to "
"calculate instantaneous amplitude and instantaneous frequency."
msgstr "**ヒルベルトスペクトル解析**: 各 IMF にヒルベルト変換を適用し、瞬時振幅と瞬時周波数を計算します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:10012
#: 60c5cd644f864e418f8a746eaa18fd11
msgid ""
"**Note**: To use this feature, the `PyEMD` (EMD-signal) package must be "
"installed."
msgstr "**注意**: この機能を使うには、`PyEMD` (EMD-signal) パッケージのインストールが必要です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30002
#: 00088fdbbfc8405096f35fa64acbaf75
msgid "1. Theoretical Background and Advantages of HHT"
msgstr "1. HHTの理論的背景と利点"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30004
#: 7e51f56baedf450ea26567605a3b3f2f
msgid "What is HHT (Hilbert-Huang Transform)?"
msgstr "HHT（ヒルベルト–黄変換）とは？"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30005
#: ef9d30a8e36844e5962cf2487cc590bc
msgid ""
"HHT is a powerful method for analyzing nonlinear and non-stationary signal "
"data. It consists of two main processes:"
msgstr "HHT は非線形・非定常な信号データを解析するための強力な手法です。 主に2つのプロセスで構成されます:"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30008
#: 5bf3eb5a9d8844779a21f0cfaf045b9a
msgid ""
"**EMD (Empirical Mode Decomposition)**: Decomposes the original signal into "
"a sum of Intrinsic Mode Functions (IMFs) with different frequency scales."
msgstr "**EMD（経験的モード分解）**: 元の信号を、それぞれ異なる周波数スケールを持つ固有モード関数（IMF）の和に分解します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30009
#: ad1cd78e17cc4af680202cfb38c55685
msgid ""
"**HSA (Hilbert Spectral Analysis)**: Applies the Hilbert transform to each "
"IMF to calculate **Instantaneous Frequency** and instantaneous amplitude."
msgstr "**HSA（ヒルベルトスペクトル解析）**: 各 IMF にヒルベルト変換を適用し、**瞬時周波数**と瞬時振幅を算出します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30011
#: be9f667650f94f91b11331e730e59905
msgid "Differences from Traditional STFT"
msgstr "従来の STFT との違い"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30012
#: 10154736947843ca9410c48ba3dc4252
msgid ""
"Short-Time Fourier Transform (STFT) and wavelet transforms have a trade-off "
"between time resolution and frequency resolution (limited by the uncertainty"
" principle). In contrast, HHT adaptively generates basis functions based on "
"local time scales, so it is not subject to this limitation and can achieve "
"**high time and frequency resolution** simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"短時間フーリエ変換（STFT）やウェーブレット変換では、時間分解能と周波数分解能の間にトレードオフ（不確定性原理による制限）があります。 一方、HHT "
"は局所的な時間スケールに基づいて適応的に基底関数を生成するため、この制限を受けず、**高い時間・周波数分解能を同時に実現**できます。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30015
#: c096b745031948a49884bef7ab29dbb6
msgid "EEMD (Ensemble EMD)"
msgstr "EEMD（アンサンブル EMD）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30016
#: ccc7bdf2ae49409195627d3765b715b7
msgid ""
"In standard EMD, \"mode mixing\" can occur where different frequency "
"components are mixed within a single IMF due to intermittent signals or "
"noise. To solve this, **EEMD (Ensemble EMD)** has been proposed."
msgstr ""
"標準的な EMD では、断続的な信号やノイズにより、1つの IMF に異なる周波数成分が混在する「モード混合」が生じることがあります。 "
"これを解決するため、**EEMD（Ensemble EMD）** が提案されています。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30018
#: e8832f3a03ec429b8d52662670eb89fa
msgid ""
"Generate multiple ensemble members by adding white noise to the original "
"signal."
msgstr "元の信号に白色ノイズを加えた複数のアンサンブルメンバーを生成する"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30019
#: ee32017c7052473db554ede1018f0f28
msgid "Perform EMD on each signal."
msgstr "各信号に EMD を実行する"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30020
#: 5c759ac6056142f98f930825d20501fd
msgid ""
"Take the ensemble average of the resulting IMFs to cancel out the noise and "
"stably extract physically meaningful modes."
msgstr "得られた IMF のアンサンブル平均を取り、ノイズをキャンセルして物理的に意味のあるモードを安定して抽出する"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:30022
#: 42e049e8f46545f784e107c869b4c3ee
msgid ""
"**Physical intent**: in CCSN-like signals we care about whether an extracted"
" ridge tracks a real mode family, such as SASI or a proto-neutron-star "
"oscillation, rather than a basis artefact created by a fixed window."
msgstr ""
"**物理的意図**: CCSN 由来の信号では、固定窓が作る見かけの筋ではなく、SASI "
"や原始中性子星振動のような実在するモード族を追跡できるかが重要です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:40002
#: 8f7e53d57111464c98878cfc64eb48ee
msgid "2. Simulation: Reproducing SASI Modes"
msgstr "2. シミュレーション：SASIモードの再現"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:40004
#: f0ee685c154d4bb59e7b7cd9955cc0be
msgid ""
"In gravitational wave analysis of core-collapse supernovae (CCSN), the "
"instability called **SASI (Standing Accretion Shock Instability)** is an "
"important observation target. Here, we create a **Sine-Gaussian** signal "
"simulating gravitational waves from SASI and analyze it (Reference: Takeda "
"et al. 2021)."
msgstr ""
"重力崩壊型超新星（CCSN）の重力波解析において、**SASI（定在降着衝撃不安定性）** と呼ばれる不安定性は重要な観測対象です。 "
"ここでは、SASIからの重力波を模した **サイン・ガウシアン** 信号を生成して解析します（参考文献: Takeda et al. 2021）。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:40007
#: baad14b03e734e8b977bc8b8f40a967f
msgid ""
"The Sine-Gaussian signal is expressed by the following equation: $$ h(t) = A"
" \\exp\\left( - \\left( \\frac{2\\pi (t - t_0)}{t_{\\text{width}}} "
"\\right)^2 \\right) \\sin(2\\pi f_0 t) $$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:60002
#: 579a94db72d144ee915fadabd88ee863
msgid "3. Comparative Analysis: STFT vs HHT"
msgstr "3. 比較分析：STFT vs HHT"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:60004
#: d9dd79a995cf4cecac906dea4f2dd586
msgid ""
"We apply STFT (spectrogram) and HHT (Hilbert spectrum) to the same signal "
"and compare their resolution differences."
msgstr "同じ信号に STFT（スペクトログラム）と HHT（ヒルベルトスペクトル）を適用し、分解能の違いを比較します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:60006
#: f51fb3a41be144b696732c145b48d386
msgid ""
"**Note**: In the following results, STFT may appear more robust to noise and"
" the signal may look cleaner. This is because standard EMD is susceptible to"
" noise and causes \"mode mixing.\" This problem is dramatically improved by "
"using **EEMD**, which we will introduce in the next section, but let's first"
" check the basic behavior of HHT."
msgstr ""
"**注意**: 以下の結果では、STFT の方がノイズに対してロバストに見え、信号がよりクリアに見える場合があります。 これは、標準的な EMD "
"がノイズの影響を受けやすく「モード混合」を起こすためです。 この問題は、次のセクションで紹介する **EEMD** "
"を使用することで大幅に改善されますが、まずは HHT の基本的な動作を確認しましょう。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:60010
#: 50f4a59c41e242f38335008c79516196
msgid ""
"**Common mistake**: reading every sharp HHT ridge as a physical mode. If the"
" ridge fragments when you perturb the padding, decomposition method, or IMF "
"count, it is more likely a decomposition artefact than a robust signal "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"**よくある誤り**: 鋭い HHT のリッジをすべて物理的なモードと解釈してしまうこと。パディング・分解手法・IMF "
"数を変えるとリッジが分裂する場合、それは頑健な信号特徴というより分解由来のアーティファクトである可能性が高いです。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80002
#: 6ab223192559467ba0343233e9f52e35
msgid "4. Application: Mode Extraction and Parameter Estimation with EEMD"
msgstr "4. 応用：EEMDによるモード抽出とパラメータ推定"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80004
#: e7ef8ea7875d46e58a10501debd7e646
msgid "Applying EEMD"
msgstr "EEMDの適用"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80005
#: a25b279d1850485ea8ab9e9120473a7d
msgid ""
"In the simple EMD results above, the frequency may oscillate due to the "
"influence of noise, or the original 130Hz signal may be split into multiple "
"IMFs (mode mixing). Using **EEMD (Ensemble EMD)** can improve this."
msgstr ""
"上記の単純な EMD の結果では、ノイズの影響により周波数が振動したり、本来の 130Hz 信号が複数の IMF "
"に分割される（モード混合）ことがあります。 **EEMD（Ensemble EMD）** を使用することでこれを改善できます。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80008
#: c715be3a56814a49b5f93fc4edff029d
msgid ""
"In **Sasaoka et al. (2024)**, it was shown that in gravitational wave "
"analysis from CCSN, using EEMD (or CEEMD) can accurately extract the "
"oscillation modes of the proto-neutron star (PNS) and estimate PNS physical "
"quantities (mass-to-radius ratio $M/R^2$) from the frequency evolution."
msgstr ""
"**Sasaoka et al. (2024)** では、CCSN からの重力波解析において、EEMD（または CEEMD）を用いることで原始中性子星 "
"(PNS) の振動モードを正確に抽出し、その周波数進化から PNS の物理量（質量・半径比 $M/R^2$）を推定できることが示されました。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80010
#: 291cb0a0ef154280aa522fa2eeddccef
msgid ""
"The following code is an example of running EEMD using gwexpy's "
"`TimeSeries.hht()`."
msgstr "以下のコードは、gwexpy の `TimeSeries.hht()` を使用して EEMD を実行する例です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:80012
#: d508f676136244bf9c6b8bec09321d56
msgid ""
"**Failure mode to watch for**: increasing `eemd_trials` can stabilise IMFs, "
"but it does not rescue a poor band selection or a signal dominated by "
"broadband transients. If the target physics is a narrow drifting mode, crop "
"to a plausible time/frequency region first instead of hoping EEMD will "
"separate everything automatically."
msgstr ""
"**注意すべき失敗モード**: `eemd_trials` を増やすと IMF "
"は安定しやすくなりますが、不適切な帯域選択や、広帯域トランジェントが支配的な信号を救えるわけではありません。対象の物理が狭帯域でドリフトするモードなら、EEMD"
" がすべてを自動分離してくれることを期待せず、まず妥当な時間・周波数領域に切り出してください。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:100002
#: ed181e89b54c4a00aa90b01e4abbd847
msgid "5. Hilbert Spectrum (HHTSpectrogram)"
msgstr "5. ヒルベルトスペクトル (HHTSpectrogram)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:100004
#: 4be78d6e3a434a5295c768e76e3c57e8
msgid ""
"By specifying `output='spectrogram'`, you can obtain a time-frequency map. "
"By default, `HHTSpectrogram.plot()` uses a logarithmic scale."
msgstr ""
"`output='spectrogram'` を指定すると時間-周波数マップを得られます。`HHTSpectrogram.plot()` "
"は既定で対数スケールです。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120002
#: 4ffc8f85ed9b4e10a62148daeacd5872
msgid "6. Low-level APIs (Optional)"
msgstr "6. 低レベルAPIについて（任意）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120004
#: 70e97de073ab44c18619253999ea6598
msgid ""
"For more fine-grained control, you can directly use the following methods:"
msgstr "詳細制御が必要な場合は以下を直接使用できます:"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120005
#: 8b076156e9a14a0a9511022df72196b3
msgid "`emd()` for decomposition."
msgstr "`emd()`（分解）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120006
#: 82e4154c9f874ff691589171f08b3bba
msgid "`hilbert_analysis()` for IA/IF calculation."
msgstr "`hilbert_analysis()`（IA/IF）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120007
#: 501564eb35fc420d84003fc0f174e538
msgid "`instantaneous_frequency()` / `envelope()` for individual IMFs."
msgstr "`instantaneous_frequency()` / `envelope()`（個別 IMF）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:120009
#: 7f30b592a22f48ad814057ce58ff5dc1
msgid "However, using `hht()` is recommended for general analysis."
msgstr "通常の解析では `hht()` が推奨です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:130002
#: fc741552baa048c49654f545ed60c88a
msgid "Hints"
msgstr "ヒント"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:130003
#: 9cbe5cef15544024b564c98f63ed2ba3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Edge effects are common in Hilbert analysis. Consider using "
"`hilbert_kwargs={'pad': N}` to mitigate this, and ignore the very ends of "
"the data."
msgstr "端点効果が出やすいので `hilbert_kwargs={'pad': N}` を検討し、端は無視してください。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:130004
#: 0fbb765d899841498818026cd92b4262
msgid ""
"If you need smoother IMFs, increase `eemd_trials` (this will increase "
"computation time)."
msgstr "より滑らかな IMF が必要なら `eemd_trials` を増やします（計算時間増）。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:130005
#: 0d1393f48bdb42df80365f0a8570f10a
msgid "For strict reproducibility, use `emd_method='emd'`."
msgstr "再現性重視なら `emd_method='emd'` を使います。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:130006
#: 633abdd16fd84598906d30b37368cc5c
msgid ""
"Do not interpret negative or rapidly sign-flipping instantaneous frequency "
"samples near amplitude nulls; mask low-amplitude regions before turning IF "
"into physics."
msgstr ""
"振幅が極端に小さい区間では瞬時周波数が負になったり激しく符号反転したりしやすいので、そのまま物理量として読まず低振幅領域をマスクしてください。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140002
#: 61d7c9b6bd05490ba476c8a5e77ee33f
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "まとめ"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140003
#: fdc97308a827498e99e375d9d79996d6
msgid ""
"Using `TimeSeries.hht()` allows you to practically apply the theoretical "
"power of HHT:"
msgstr "`TimeSeries.hht()` を使うと、理論的な強力さを持つ HHT を実践的に活用できます:"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140004
#: dd62e0bae8d248959049ec70152c6067
msgid ""
"Tracking instantaneous frequencies of non-stationary signals like SASI "
"(Section 2)."
msgstr "SASI などの非定常重力波信号の瞬時周波数追跡（§2）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140005
#: e1737d51f153486a90e3693329eec654
msgid "Confirming superior resolution compared to STFT (Section 3)."
msgstr "STFT との比較による分解能の優位性確認（§3）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140006
#: 0e1da62c90624017b37a2d6d194f3309
msgid ""
"Resolving mode mixing and estimating physical quantities using EEMD (Section"
" 4)."
msgstr "EEMD によるモード混合の解消と物理量推定（§4）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140007
#: 5d5c0f2b7e4f4872aed257f0a9e04e19
msgid "Obtaining time-frequency maps with `output='spectrogram'` (Section 5)."
msgstr "`output='spectrogram'` で時間-周波数マップを取得（§5）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_hht.ipynb:140009
#: cbadfb8247c04b5ea5181c8149fca21a
msgid ""
"In practice, the reliable workflow is: isolate the physics you care about, "
"verify that the IMF/ridge is stable under modest analysis changes, and only "
"then interpret the instantaneous frequency as a mode tracker."
msgstr ""
"実運用では、狙う物理を先に切り出し、IMF や ridge "
"が小さな解析条件変更に対して安定かを確かめ、その後ではじめて瞬時周波数をモード追跡へ解釈するのが安全です。"
